1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,433
This is Episode 36.

3
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:10,585
Maya needs three jobs done.

4
00:00:10,585 --> 00:00:12,553
Cups first.

5
00:00:12,553 --> 00:00:14,454
Then mixing.

6
00:00:14,454 --> 00:00:16,356
Then pouring.

7
00:00:16,356 --> 00:00:18,683
She claps once.

8
00:00:18,683 --> 00:00:21,914
Everyone starts at the same time.

9
00:00:21,914 --> 00:00:23,510
Oh no!

10
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:27,220
Lulu pours lemonade into thin air.

11
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,255
No cups yet.

12
00:00:29,255 --> 00:00:31,077
What a mess.

13
00:00:31,077 --> 00:00:33,723
Here comes the staircase.

14
00:00:33,723 --> 00:00:36,888
Sammy stands on the first step.

15
00:00:36,888 --> 00:00:38,736
It lights up.

16
00:00:38,736 --> 00:00:41,210
He sets out the cups.

17
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,162
Now the second step lights.

18
00:00:44,162 --> 00:00:46,555
Eddie mixes the jug.

19
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,454
Now the third step lights.

20
00:00:49,454 --> 00:00:51,529
Lulu pours.

21
00:00:51,529 --> 00:00:53,869
Every cup is full.

22
00:00:53,869 --> 00:00:56,821
The flag pops up at the top.

23
00:00:56,821 --> 00:00:59,281
One step at a time.

24
00:00:59,281 --> 00:01:02,699
Each step waits for the one before it.

25
00:01:02,699 --> 00:01:05,199
That is the staircase.

26
00:01:05,199 --> 00:01:08,311
Now you know Step Functions!

27
00:01:08,311 --> 00:01:13,005
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

